usage: predict.py [-h] --input_dir INPUT_DIR --model
                  {baseline1,baseline2,baseline3,final} --output_dir
                  OUTPUT_DIR --counts_file COUNTS_FILE [--config CONFIG]
                  [--bundle BUNDLE] [--record-timing]

Contract batch CLI; uses exactly the same registered backends as app.py.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --input_dir INPUT_DIR
  --model {baseline1,baseline2,baseline3,final}
  --output_dir OUTPUT_DIR
  --counts_file COUNTS_FILE
  --config CONFIG
  --bundle BUNDLE       Override model bundle path
  --record-timing       Offline adapter processing time; excludes
                        decoding/loading and is not live latency
